{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Pelican Town is where the player moves to at the start of the game, located in Stardew Valley. Pelican Town is where most of the ",["l","居民","villagers"]," live, work, and socialize."]],["p",[["l","刘易斯","Lewis"]," is the mayor of Pelican Town and has been for over 20 years; he comments that he has not had competition for the role since first becoming mayor."]],["p",["The northwest entrance to town connects to the ",["l","巴士站","Bus Stop"]," and ",["l","农场","the Farm"],". The southwest passage connects to ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"],", which contains ",["l","玛妮的牧场","Marnie's Ranch"],", ",["l","莉亚的农舍","Leah's Cottage"],", and the ",["l","法师塔","Wizard's Tower"],". Directly south of town is ",["l","沙滩","the Beach"],". North of town connects to ",["l","深山","the Mountain"],", with ",["l","木匠的商店","Robin's Carpenter Shop"],", ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],", the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"],", the ",["l","铁路","Railroad"],", and the ",["l","采石场","Quarry"],"."]],["p",["Initially, there are ",["l","杂草","weeds"]," located near ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],", in the area behind ",["l","柳巷1号","1 Willow Lane"],", behind ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"],", and to the west of the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"],", below the playground. These weeds will die during ",["l","冬季","Winter"],", but will respawn at the start of each new year."]],["p",["When attempting to cut most trees in Pelican Town, a message will show saying \"I shouldn't cut down trees in town.\""]]]],["Key Locations",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Residents"]}],[[["f","Pierres_shop.png",150]],[["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","Pierre's General Store"]],[["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"]]],[[["f","Medical_Clinic.png",100]],[["l","哈维的诊所","Clinic"]],[["l","哈维","Harvey"]]],[[["f","Community_Center.png",200]],[["l","社区中心","Community Center"]],[["f","Junimo_Icon.png",32]," ",["l","祝尼魔","Junimos"]]],[[["f","Museum.png",200]],[["l","博物馆","Museum"]],[["l","冈瑟","Gunther"]]],[[["f","Blacksmith.png",200]],[["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]],[["l","克林特","Clint"]]],[[["f","Jojamart.png",200]],[["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"]],[["l","莫里斯","Morris"]]],[[["f","Saloon.png",150]],[["l","星之果实酒吧","The Stardrop Saloon"]],[["l","格斯","Gus"]]],[[["f","Bookseller.png",175]],[["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," shop"],[["f","Bookseller_Icon.png",24],["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]]]]]]],["Other Residents",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Residents"]}],[[["f","1_River_Road.png",100]],[["l","河间大道1号","1 River Road"]],[["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],["l","乔治","George"]]],[[["f","Trailer.png",100]],[["l","拖车","Trailer"]],[["l","潘姆","Pam"],["l","潘妮","Penny"]]],[[["f","Mayor's_Manor.png",100]],[["l","镇长的庄园","Mayor's Manor"]],[["l","刘易斯","Lewis"]]],[[["f","1_Willow_Lane.png",100]],[["l","柳巷1号","1 Willow Lane"]],[["l","乔迪","Jodi"],["l","肯特","Kent"],["l","山姆","Sam"],["l","文森特","Vincent"]]],[[["f","2_Willow_Lane.png",100]],[["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"]],[["l","艾米丽","Emily"],["l","海莉","Haley"]]]]]]],["Special Orders Board",2,[["p",["Pelican Town has a ",["l","任务#List of Special Orders","special orders board"]," that allows you to perform quests for the various townspeople."]]]],["Trash Bear",2,[["p",["On the first non-rainy day in Year 3, Trash Bear will appear in the southern part of ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"],". Bringing 4 requested items to Trash Bear will trigger a cutscene in which Trash Bear cleans up the trash in Cindersap Forest, and the trash in the ",["l","拖车","Trailer"],"'s front yard. ",["l","狗窝","Dusty's dog pen"]," also gets an upgrade."]]]],["Foraging",2,[["g",[["TownForageLocations.thumb.webp",320,["Locations in Pelican Town where forageable items can spawn."],"TownForageLocations.webp"]]],["p",[["l","采集","Forageable"]," items found on the ground in Pelican Town are:"]],["l",0,[[1,["In ",["l","春季","Spring"],": ",["i","(O)18","Daffodil"]," (100%)"]],[1,["In ",["l","夏季","Summer"],": ",["i","(O)402","Sweet Pea"]," (100%)"]],[1,["In ",["l","秋季","Fall"],": ",["i","(O)410","Blackberry"]," (100%)"]],[1,["In ",["l","冬季","Winter"],": ",["i","(O)418","Crocus"]," (54%), ",["i","(O)283","Holly"]," (38%), and ",["i","(O)414","Crystal Fruit"]," (8%)"]]]],["p",["Forageable items spawn at an average rate of 1.2 per night in spring and summer; 0.9 per night in fall; and, 0.7 per night in winter. The map shows the possible locations as red tiles."]]]],["Artifact Spots",2,[["p",[["l","古物","Artifacts"]," that can be found by digging up ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s at Pelican Town are:"]],["l",0,[[1,[["i","(O)110","Rusty Spoon"]," (4% + 6-11%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)583","Prehistoric Rib"]," (2.2-4%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)100","Chipped Amphora"]," (3%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)103","Ancient Doll"]," (0.8%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)105","Chewing Stick"]," (0.8%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)579","Prehistoric Scapula"]," (0.7%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)106","Ornamental Fan"]," (0.6%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)123","Ancient Drum"]," (0.4%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)119","Bone Flute"]," (0.4%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)126","Strange Doll (green)"]," (0.07%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)127","Strange Doll (yellow)"]," (0.07%)"]]]],["p",["Other possible items are:"]],["l",0,[[1,[["i","(O)102","Lost Book"]," (20% + 4-8%); once all Lost Books have been found, any potential Lost Book is replaced by ",["i","(O)770","Mixed Seeds"],"."]],[1,["1-3 ",["i","(O)330","Clay"]," (12-24%)"]],[1,["Only in ",["l","冬季","Winter"],": ",["i","(O)412","Winter Root"]," (21%)"]],[1,["Only in ",["l","冬季","Winter"],": ",["i","(O)416","Snow Yam"]," (14%)"]],[1,["1-3 ",["i","(O)378","Copper Ore"]," (7-14%)"]],[1,["1-3 ",["i","(O)390","Stone"]," (4-8%)"]],[1,["Only in ",["l","春季","Spring"],": 2-5 ",["i","(O)273","Rice Shoot"],"s (4%)"]],[1,["An unseen ",["i","(O)79/1","Secret Note"],": up to 2.1% chance, only if the player has a ",["l","放大镜","Magnifying Glass"],"."]]]],["p",["Artifact spots spawn at an average rate of 0.2 per night, except in winter when the average rate increases to 0.8 per night."]]]],["Fishing",2,[["g",[["TownDistances.thumb.webp",320,[["l","钓鱼#Distance from Land","Distances from land"]," in Pelican Town."],"TownDistances.webp"]]],["p",["River ",["l","鱼","fish"]," can be caught in the river flowing through Pelican Town. In Fall, a ",["l","鱼#Legendary Fish","Legendary Fish"],", the ",["l","鮟鱇鱼","Angler"],", can be caught at the north end of the river. ",["l","雌鮟鱇鱼","Ms. Angler"],", one of the ",["l","鱼#Legendary Fish II","legendary fish II"],", can also be caught there."]],["p",["When fishing in the fountain to the left of the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"],", a present box containing a ",["l","装饰垃圾桶","Decorative Trash Can"]," (10% chance) can be found. Otherwise, a single piece of ",["l","木材","wood"]," or ",["l","石头","stone"]," will be caught, with equal probability (45% chance each)."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Fish"]},{"h":1,"v":["Location"]},{"h":1,"v":["Time"]},{"h":1,"v":["Weather"]}],[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":["Spring"]}],[[["i","(O)145","Sunfish"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Sun"]],[[["i","(O)143","Catfish"]],[],["6:00–0:00"],["Rain"]],[[["i","(O)153","Green Algae"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)137","Smallmouth Bass"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)706","Shad"]],[],["9:00–2:00"],["Rain"]],[[["i","(O)132","Bream"]],[],["18:00–2:00"],["Any"]],[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":["Summer"]}],[[["i","(O)138","Rainbow Trout"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Sun"]],[[["i","(O)145","Sunfish"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Sun"]],[[["i","(O)153","Green Algae"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)144","Pike"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)706","Shad"]],[],["9:00–2:00"],["Rain"]],[[["i","(O)132","Bream"]],[],["18:00–2:00"],["Any"]],[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":["Fall"]}],[[["i","(O)139","Salmon"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)699","Tiger Trout"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)143","Catfish"]],[],["6:00–0:00"],["Rain"]],[[["i","(O)153","Green Algae"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)137","Smallmouth Bass"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)706","Shad"]],[],["9:00–2:00"],["Rain"]],[[["i","(O)140","Walleye"]],[],["12:00–2:00"],["Rain"]],[[["i","(O)132","Bream"]],[],["18:00–2:00"],["Any"]],[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":["Winter"]}],[[["i","(O)699","Tiger Trout"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)153","Green Algae"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)707","Lingcod"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)141","Perch"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)144","Pike"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)132","Bream"]],[],["18:00–2:00"],["Any"]]]]]],["Secrets",2,[["l",0,[[1,["If a ",["l","大海参","Super Cucumber"]," is placed in the hidden brown box located in the fenced area north of the Blacksmith, the player will receive the ",["l","彩蛋","secret"]," ",["l","??HMTGF??","??HMTGF??"]," statue."]],[1,["One ",["l","兑奖券","Prize Ticket"]," can be found in a hidden gift box to the northeast of the Bookseller, in a small fenced area blocked by a ",["l","大树桩","large stump"],"."]],[1,[["l","小巷自助餐","The Alleyway Buffet"]," can be obtained from a hidden golden garbage can in the easternmost region of town, by entering a concealed opening in the eastern fence just north of the ",["l","矿车","Minecart"]," track outside of the Blacksmith. The path is blocked by a ",["l","大圆木","large log"]," and ",["l","圆石","boulder"],"."]]]]]],["Trivia",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Pelican Town is located within the Ferngill Republic, at war with the ",["l","戈特洛帝国","Gotoro Empire"]," across the Gem Sea."]],[1,["Dr. Harvey, in calling out on his shortwave radio, identifies his location (in Pelican Town) as 52 north, 43.5 east. Thus, if Stardew Valley is on Earth, it can be found near a village called Krasnoye (one of many such) in Russia - about 160 km (100 mi) WNW of Saratov, and about 600 km (375 mi) SE of Moscow. \"Krasnoye\" means \"beautiful\" or \"red\". However, it is not on a sea shore."]],[1,["The player cannot refill their ",["l","喷壶","watering can"]," from the fountain."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Introduced ",["l","煤矿森林#Trash Bear","Trash Bear"],". Debris now respawns each ",["l","春季","Spring"]," 1."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Added ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," to key locations. Added hidden containers with ",["l","兑奖券","Prize Ticket"]," and ",["l","小巷自助餐","The Alleyway Buffet"],". Now prevents the player from cutting down most trees in town."]]]]]]]}